  CI copies this in when the GOOGLE_SERVICE_INFO_PLIST secret isn't set.
  The app only needs the file to exist to get past FirebaseApp.configure();
  the unit tests cover pure model logic and never open a connection, so
  fake values are enough to build and test.

  Never ship this in a real build — the app would launch and fail to sign in.
-->
